4
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:39,000
The Eye of the Midnight Sun had launched an assault on the Forest of Witches, hoping to get their hands on the magic stone that was said to be found there.

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Meanwhile, the forest was also beset by the Diamond Kingdom, who had come to take advantage of the confusion and learn the secret of a magic technique that prevented the Queen of Witches from growing old.

6
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:57,000
