7
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,000
MILLION LASERS!

8
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:09,000
Ladros, stop. Please, I beg you. Use your power for what's right.

9
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:16,000
There's nothing better than getting an opportunity to use your power to the absolute max, and devastating any opponent that dares to stand in your way!

10
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:20,000
My goal is to be recognized all over this nation, and eventually the whole world!

11
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:24,000
