00:18:48,900 --> 00:18:49,700
Fauna!

276
00:18:49,700 --> 00:18:50,860
It's me, remember?

277
00:18:50,860 --> 00:18:51,760
It's me, remember?

278
00:18:52,600 --> 00:18:53,660
I'm so sorry!

279
00:18:54,460 --> 00:18:57,200
