280
00:18:57,980 --> 00:18:59,920
But please, forgive me!

281
00:19:02,260 --> 00:19:03,680
You're a girl, Fauna.

282
00:19:03,780 --> 00:19:05,900
It's not a good idea to overdo it.

283
00:19:06,580 --> 00:19:08,100
If I get out, I'll wait.

284
00:19:08,520 --> 00:19:09,580
I promise I will.

285
00:19:09,580 --> 00:19:10,280
I'm sorry!

286
00:19:10,500 --> 00:19:10,660
That's it!

287
00:19:10,660 --> 00:19:10,800
Not a good idea today.

288
00:19:10,800 --> 00:19:12,820
What?!

289
00:19:12,820 --> 00:19:14,860
Close the door!

290
00:19:14,860 --> 00:19:15,320
Run!

291
00:19:16,260 --> 00:19:16,560
Run!

292
00:19:20,600 --> 00:19:21,040
Everybody on this day!

293
00:19:21,300 --> 00:19:23,300
He did this!

294
00:19:23,300 --> 00:19:24,260
He's the only one that knows this place!

295
00:19:24,380 --> 00:19:25,580
I knew it!

296
00:19:25,580 --> 00:19:26,640
That human betrayed all of us!

297
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:28,680
He did this!

298
00:19:28,680 --> 00:19:32,640
He's the only one that knows this place!

299
00:19:32,640 --> 00:19:35,340
Let's keep our promise, okay?

300
00:19:35,940 --> 00:19:38,040
Someday, we'll see the world.

301
00:19:38,040 --> 00:19:40,540
Let us explore together!

302
00:20:02,640 --> 00:20:17,040
We said we would, so let's go.

303
00:20:17,040 --> 00:20:23,040
Right, Pana.

304
00:20:23,040 --> 00:20:26,040
What's wrong?

305
00:20:26,040 --> 00:20:42,040
Well, that's a relief.

306
00:20:42,040 --> 00:20:44,040
Yeah, I'm glad.

307
00:20:44,040 --> 00:20:46,040
Lucky!

308
00:20:56,040 --> 00:20:58,040
We'll see you next time.

309
00:20:58,040 --> 00:21:00,040
We'll see you next time.

310
00:21:00,040 --> 00:21:02,040
Bye.

311
00:21:26,040 --> 00:21:28,040
Bye.

