316
00:22:36,040 --> 00:22:37,040
By the way, Mars.

317
00:22:37,040 --> 00:22:42,040
How's your life been going since you defeated me?

318
00:22:42,040 --> 00:22:46,040
I still feel really bad about that.

319
00:22:46,040 --> 00:22:48,040
Ta-da!

320
00:22:48,040 --> 00:22:50,040
Look at this grimoire.

321
00:22:50,040 --> 00:22:51,040
That's odd.

322
00:22:51,040 --> 00:22:53,040
Looks half like mine.

323
00:22:53,040 --> 00:22:54,040
Right!

324
00:22:54,040 --> 00:22:56,300
That's because it's been imbued with your magic power.

325
00:22:56,800 --> 00:22:58,460
That way, you're always with me.

326
00:22:58,800 --> 00:23:00,500
Wow, that's creepy.

327
00:23:01,980 --> 00:23:04,980
Well, it was made by Morris, the Mage Scholar.

328
00:23:06,240 --> 00:23:08,920
He wiped my memories and modified my body.

329
00:23:09,480 --> 00:23:12,120
So I was forced to fight who I was told.

330
00:23:12,920 --> 00:23:16,120
But battling Asta in that dungeon made me remember.

331
00:23:17,020 --> 00:23:18,220
And here's the best part.

332
00:23:18,220 --> 00:23:19,840
In an effort to make it up to you,

333
00:23:19,960 --> 00:23:23,020
