334
00:23:23,360 --> 00:23:23,940
Nice, right?

335
00:23:24,680 --> 00:23:26,140
Yes, good boy.

336
00:23:27,260 --> 00:23:29,660
You still hurt me, but good boy.

337
00:23:35,420 --> 00:23:37,680
I'm so jealous, I can't stand it!

338
00:23:37,880 --> 00:23:40,300
But since I'm his elder, I'll take the high road on this one.

339
00:23:40,480 --> 00:23:41,780
I am older than him, right?

340
00:23:42,180 --> 00:23:44,600
Anyway, congrats to Mars and Fauna, I guess.

341
00:23:45,300 --> 00:23:47,020
Black Clover, page 62.

342
